From: "Laze ." <laze.@MacBook-Pro-50.local>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 14:05:58 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add opt-in native sunlight depth map for Aurora

Render opaque and cutout terrain from a stabilized solar camera, expose filtered material visibility through the local shadow.1 API, and preserve the water.3 contract and previous API lines.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
